गल gal-a, m. throat, neck: -vārtta, a. living 🞄only for his throat (= belly);
 -śuṇḍikā, f. 🞄uvula: du. soft palate;
 -hasta, m. hand on 🞄(= seizure by) the throat.

गलितक galita-ka, m. kind of dance or gesticulation;
 🞄-pradīpa, m., -pradipikā, f. Lamp 🞄of omitted passages. T. of a work;
 -vayas, a. 🞄whose youth is past, stricken in years, aged.
